{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37544","headline":"送司封从叔员外徼赴华州裴尚书均辟 · 郑谷","name":"送司封从叔员外徼赴华州裴尚书均辟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如何抛锦帐，莲府对莲峰。\n旧有云霞约，暂留鵷鹭踪。\n敷溪秋雪岸，树谷夕阳钟。\n尽入新吟境，归朝兴莫慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}